   "text": "Batching\nweights read ONCE per step,\nshared by N users' tokens.\nEach user's KV still read separately.\nB=1 -> 1 token per weight read\nB=8 -> 8 tokens per weight read",
   "originalText": "Batching\nweights read ONCE per step,\nshared by N users' tokens.\nEach user's KV still read separately.\nB=1 -> 1 token per weight read\nB=8 -> 8 tokens per weight read",
