   "seed": 1486419997,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1905274835,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Admission limits (checked per waiting request)\n\nmax_num_seqs: batch-size cap (start at 16)\nprefill token budget per step (start at 2,048)\nenough free blocks for its prompt\n(after prefix hits) + a small safety watermark\n\nStarting values, not calculated optima:\ntuned from the concurrency sweep (1, 2, 4, 8, 16).\nHead of the queue doesn't fit -> stop (FCFS).\nFirst: batch-size cap only. Then: blocks + preemption.\nPolicy is pluggable: FCFS now, fair share later.",
   "originalText": "Admission limits (checked per waiting request)\n\nmax_num_seqs: batch-size cap (start at 16)\nprefill token budget per step (start at 2,048)\nenough free blocks for its prompt\n(after prefix hits) + a small safety watermark\n\nStarting values, not calculated optima:\ntuned from the concurrency sweep (1, 2, 4, 8, 16).\nHead of the queue doesn't fit -> stop (FCFS).\nFirst: batch-size cap only. Then: blocks + preemption.\nPolicy is pluggable: FCFS now, fair share later.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "7reyq4e7jk4kaux9",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
