   "text": "YES (this example) -> PREFILL step\nrun D's whole prompt: input [1, prompt length]\nA and B wait for this one step",
   "originalText": "YES (this example) -> PREFILL step\nrun D's whole prompt: input [1, prompt length]\nA and B wait for this one step",
