   "text": "Measure + test\nMetrics: waiting queue length, batch size per\nstep, step time, preemptions, tokens per step.\nTests: every request finishes, FCFS order kept,\nzero leaked blocks at the end, greedy output\nsame at batch 1 and batch 8 (check near-ties).",
   "originalText": "Measure + test\nMetrics: waiting queue length, batch size per\nstep, step time, preemptions, tokens per step.\nTests: every request finishes, FCFS order kept,\nzero leaked blocks at the end, greedy output\nsame at batch 1 and batch 8 (check near-ties).",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
