   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "SSE in one line\nThe HTTP response stays open, and the server\nwrites 'data: ...' lines as tokens arrive.\nOne-way, plain HTTP, works through proxies:\nit's what OpenAI uses, no WebSocket needed.",
   "originalText": "SSE in one line\nThe HTTP response stays open, and the server\nwrites 'data: ...' lines as tokens arrive.\nOne-way, plain HTTP, works through proxies:\nit's what OpenAI uses, no WebSocket needed.",
