   "text": "<|im_start|>system\n# Tools   (written in by the chat template)\n<tools>\n{\"name\": \"get_weather\", \"parameters\": {\"city\": \"string\"}}\n</tools>\nTo call one, reply inside <tool_call></tool_call> tags.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nWhat's the weather in Pune?<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant",
