   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Never crash.\nReturn the text as\nnormal content and\ncount the failure.\n\nThe tool-call eval\n(S11) = % of calls\nthat parse and match\nthe schema.",
   "originalText": "Never crash.\nReturn the text as\nnormal content and\ncount the failure.\n\nThe tool-call eval\n(S11) = % of calls\nthat parse and match\nthe schema.",
