   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Agents = many rounds\nEvery round resends the whole history, so round N\nshares its prefix with round N-1. Prefix caching (S3)\nkeeps TTFT low: that's workload D.",
   "originalText": "Agents = many rounds\nEvery round resends the whole history, so round N\nshares its prefix with round N-1. Prefix caching (S3)\nkeeps TTFT low: that's workload D.",
