   "text": "Why the engines are NOT\nin Docker: on a Mac, Docker\nruns a Linux VM that can't\nreach the Metal GPU, so MLX\nwould crawl on the CPU.\n\nPrometheus reaches them at\nhost.docker.internal:8001-3.",
