   "text": "orange = 1 decode token, blue P = prefill. Requests join and leave between steps.\nEmpty cells for B and C in steps 7 and 11 = the prefill-first stall (S4): a long\nprompt (E) makes everyone else wait for that step.",
   "originalText": "orange = 1 decode token, blue P = prefill. Requests join and leave between steps.\nEmpty cells for B and C in steps 7 and 11 = the prefill-first stall (S4): a long\nprompt (E) makes everyone else wait for that step.",
