   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why canvas, not plain React\n2,300 squares re-rendered 15x/s as page elements\nis slow. React for layout and controls, canvas\nto paint the grid and the batch strip.",
   "originalText": "Why canvas, not plain React\n2,300 squares re-rendered 15x/s as page elements\nis slow. React for layout and controls, canvas\nto paint the grid and the batch strip.",
   "fontSize": 14,
