   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Never slow the engine, and prove it\nBounded bus, drops the oldest event; closed tab = 0 cost.\nBenchmark with telemetry on vs off and report the\noverhead (expect ~1%). SSE, not WebSocket: one-way.",
   "originalText": "Never slow the engine, and prove it\nBounded bus, drops the oldest event; closed tab = 0 cost.\nBenchmark with telemetry on vs off and report the\noverhead (expect ~1%). SSE, not WebSocket: one-way.",
