   "text": "After EVERY op, check:\n\nno block owned twice\nref counts >= 0\nfree + used + cached\n= total (no leaks)\nref >= 1: never on the\nfree list or evicted\nfreed blocks reusable",
   "originalText": "After EVERY op, check:\n\nno block owned twice\nref counts >= 0\nfree + used + cached\n= total (no leaks)\nref >= 1: never on the\nfree list or evicted\nfreed blocks reusable",
