   "text": "Rules for honest evals\nFixed datasets checked into the repo, greedy\ndecoding, the same template + thinking setting.\nNever tune prompts on the eval set itself.",
   "originalText": "Rules for honest evals\nFixed datasets checked into the repo, greedy\ndecoding, the same template + thinking setting.\nNever tune prompts on the eval set itself.",
