   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Never cut the quantization evals\nThey count for BOTH AI roles (evals: 22 of 30\npostings) and inference roles (quantization\nwith quality checks: ~9 of 29).",
   "originalText": "Never cut the quantization evals\nThey count for BOTH AI roles (evals: 22 of 30\npostings) and inference roles (quantization\nwith quality checks: ~9 of 29).",
