   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The near-tie caveat\nBatching regroups bf16 math, so a nearly tied\ntop-2 pick can flip and the texts diverge.\nLog the margin; explain it in DESIGN.md.",
