   "text": "Fair run conditions (a fanless Air throttles)\nPlugged in, Low Power Mode off, apps closed,\n2-min cooldown, discard a warm-up run,\nmedian of 3 runs, log GPU frequency\n(powermetrics). Long matrices unattended.",
