   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Fair comparisons\nSame model, prompts, max_tokens, thinking setting.\nOllama can't load MLX weights: use its closest\nquantization and say so. Count real output\ntokens, so an early stop doesn't look 'faster'.",
   "originalText": "Fair comparisons\nSame model, prompts, max_tokens, thinking setting.\nOllama can't load MLX weights: use its closest\nquantization and say so. Count real output\ntokens, so an early stop doesn't look 'faster'.",
